sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-tozluoglu-wing-disc-dome-folding> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-tozluoglu-wing-disc-dome-folding-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-tozluoglu-wing-disc-dome-folding-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Tozluoglu et al. (2019) Dev. Cell & Sui et al. (2018) Nat. Commun. Drosophila wing imaginal disc planar differential growth, basal ECM dome & H/N, H/H, H/P hinge folding — MorphoEval overall 93.7/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 2 (v2) evaluation of `2020-tozluoglu-wing-disc-dome-folding.py` (overall weighted score: 93.6/100, up from 56.8/100 in v1). The remediated script solves the 2D sagittal apico-basal bilayer morphoelastic cross-section via L-BFGS-B from 64 h to 96 h AEL; reproduces the pouch dome elevation trajectory (r = 0.9984), 15-point H/N, H/H, and H/P fold depth progression (r = 0.9952), and 7-zone spatial curvature profile (r = 1.0000); validates all 5 perturbations including uniform-growth unpinned buckling across replicate seeds, Collagenase / vkg-RNAi basal ECM ablation dome flattening and fold collapse, JAK/STAT hinge overgrowth, and dysfusion/omb tension loss; and segments the SHA-256-locked CC BY-SA 2.5 Drosophila wing disc micrograph (`drosophila_wing_disc_specimen.jpg`, n = 3 discs, s_HH = 0.3910, mean fold position error = 0.0028, pouch dome fraction = 0.4810). Overall 93.7/100 (faithfulness 93.5, reproducibility 94.1); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit e93f00e; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 94, Morphological realism / specimen match 93, Parameter expressivity 93, Morphometric validation 94, Source and data traceability 95, Code-to-model traceability 93, Reproducibility package 94. Output judged: docs/media/wing_disc_dome_folding_comparison.png: rendered output of 2020-tozluoglu-wing-disc-dome-folding.py at e93f00e, image/png, 605395 B, 2141×1432 px, artifact_sha256 e116a8b585784bc50754c7764a7cb4b05e079f5194b2ef268a9c9e4041730861 (sha256 e116a8b585784bc50754c7764a7cb4b05e079f5194b2ef268a9c9e4041730861), spec_fingerprint bcd73f8cd05a798cd28d5d8699091decf2998046dc76356ac2ad3f948db43ac8. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: bcd73f8cd05a798cd28d5d8699091decf2998046dc76356ac2ad3f948db43ac8; artifact_sha256: e116a8b585784bc50754c7764a7cb4b05e079f5194b2ef268a9c9e4041730861; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/wing_disc_dome_folding/drosophila_wing_disc_specimen.jpg=b523296d0ee292e1..., datasets/wing_disc_dome_folding/scout_manifest.json=0f2a2d1d54a8d262..., datasets/wing_disc_dome_folding/wing_disc_dome_folding_reference.json=c4c99a6cca181df7...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-wing-disc-dome-folding-audit." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Extend the 2D sagittal apico-basal bilayer solver to a full 3D finite-element mesh coupling the columnar disc proper to the overlying squamous peripodial epithelium and lumenal hydrostatic pressure." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.937"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (MorphoEval Autonomous Loop Slot 049 Pass 2 Assessor)" ;
        dct:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

